1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Chintu: BHAAAAI!!

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:09,682
Bunty: Haan bhai, ye main hoon. Soch rahe hoge... yahan tak pahuncha kaise?

3
00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:30,584
Chintu: Hatt! Chal na yaar!

4
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:37,400
Bunty: Aa gaya main! PALM BAY CITY!

5
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:41,200
Bunty: Aaj se is sheher ka DON... main hoon!

6
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:44,827
Chintu: Mmmph! Mmmph!!

7
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,900
Chintu: Bhai... mera toh spawn hi bug ho gaya.

8
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:54,460
Bunty: Chintu, focus! Open world hai. Kuch bhi kar sakte hain!

9
00:00:54,350 --> 00:00:58,791
Chintu: Kuch bhi? Toh chalo ghar chalte hain. Mummy wait kar rahi hogi.

10
00:00:58,600 --> 00:01:01,200
Bunty: GHAR NAHI!! Pehle MISSION!

11
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,701
Chintu: Chori?! Bhai, mummy ko pata chala toh...

12
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:17,200
Bunty: Dekh Chintu... ab dekh PRO GAMER MOVE.

13
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:20,400
Chintu: Theek hai bhai, main lookout pe hoon!

14
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Dadi: AE! Meri gaadi ko haath lagaya?!

15
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:30,000
Bunty: D-Dadi ji... main toh bas iski dhool saaf kar raha tha!

16
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:39,400
Chintu: Bhai... Dadi ne humse better gaadi chalayi.

17
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:45,800
Bunty: Koi baat nahi! Asli SUPERCAR toh ye hai!

18
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,600
Chintu: Bhai... ye cycle hai.

19
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:52,600
Bunty: Haan. Aur iska engine... HUM hain!

20
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:06,400
Chintu: Bhai, sab humein overtake kar rahe hain.

21
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:10,200
Bunty: Wo log jaldi mein hain. Hum... STYLE mein hain.

22
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:14,000
Chintu: ...kachhua bhi?

23
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:19,600
Chintu: Bhai! Ghanti bajane pe bhi star?!

24
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:23,600
Police Uncle: AE CYCLE WAALE! Helmet kahan hai?!

25
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:26,600
Bunty: Pakad ke dikhao, uncle!

26
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:30,200
Police Uncle: Ruk ja! Abhi batata hoon!

27
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:33,200
Chintu: Bhai jaldi pedal maar!!

28
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:37,624
Bunty: Mere pair ab pair nahi rahe... PANKHE ban gaye hain!

29
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,600
Chintu: Bhai aage RAMP!

30
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:42,200
Bunty: Pakad ke baith, Chintu!

31
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:46,600
Chintu: BHAAAAI HUM UD RAHE HAIN!!

32
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:50,920
Police Uncle: Arre... ye toh ud gaye!

33
00:02:58,500 --> 00:03:01,500
Lala Ji: Tum log... DJ ho kya?

34
00:03:02,900 --> 00:03:05,500
Bunty: ...Haan! HUM hi DJ hain!

35
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:13,500
Chintu: Bhai ye toh HIT ho gaya!

36
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:16,700
Bunty: Talent chhupta nahi, Chintu!

37
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:22,300
Lala Ji: Wah! Tum log kaam ke aadmi ho. Ek chhota sa kaam karoge?

38
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:24,500
Bunty: Haan haan! Bolo!

39
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:27,600
Lala Ji: Bank... lootna hai.

40
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,100
Bunty: HAAN!

41
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,423
Chintu: NAHI!

42
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:31,800
Bunty: HAAN!!

43
00:03:31,900 --> 00:03:33,800
Chintu: ...haan.

44
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:45,900
Bunty: Garage door hai. Fast travel karte hain!

45
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:49,700
Chintu: Bhai, fast travel ka loading screen yaad hai na?

46
00:03:49,900 --> 00:03:52,700
Bunty: Is baar jaldi hoga. Trust me!

47
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:01,463
Chintu: Phir se 99 pe atak gaya!

48
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:04,000
Bunty: Dekha? Ekdum fast!

49
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:06,400
Chintu: ...haan bhai. Bilkul.

50
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:12,832
Bunty: Toh suno. Ye hai mera MASTER PLAN.

51
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:15,700
Bunty: Step 1: Bank jaayenge.

52
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:18,500
Bunty: Step 2: Paisa lenge.

53
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:22,300
Bunty: Aur Step 4... PARTYYYY!

54
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:25,300
Chintu: Bhai... Step 3 kya hai?

55
00:04:25,500 --> 00:04:27,700
Bunty: Wo... surprise hai.

56
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:31,356
Chintu: Aur agar pakde gaye toh? Escape plan kya hai?

57
00:04:31,300 --> 00:04:35,053
Bunty: Escape plan ye hai ki... hum pakde hi NAHI jaayenge.

58
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:42,100
Chintu: ...plan toh solid hai bhai.

59
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:50,567
bhola: Aaiye aaiye! Swagat hai, swagat hai!

60
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:55,216
Bunty: Uncle, bank lootne ke liye koi disguise dikhao.

61
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:58,689
bhola: Bilkul! Ek se badhkar ek!

62
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:01,245
Chintu: Bhai, ye toh Western film hai.

63
00:05:01,700 --> 00:05:04,500
Bunty: Main hoon... CAPTAIN BUNTY!

64
00:05:05,100 --> 00:05:08,695
Chintu: Bhai, ye dakaiti hai, shaadi nahi!

65
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:12,198
bhola: Ye 80s ka disco special hai!

66
00:05:11,900 --> 00:05:14,900
Bunty: Perfect! Ekdum professional dakait.

67
00:05:15,100 --> 00:05:18,100
bhola: Total huye... paanch sau rupaye.

68
00:05:18,300 --> 00:05:20,900
Bunty: Uncle... udhaar chalega?

69
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:26,383
bhola: Mask udhaar pe le jao. Aur tumhare dost ke liye... ye free wala.

70
00:05:26,100 --> 00:05:28,900
Chintu: Bhai... kuch dikh nahi raha.

71
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:39,900
Bunty: KOI HILEGA NAHI! Ye DAKAITI hai!

72
00:05:42,100 --> 00:05:45,100
Cashier: Line mein aaiye. Pehle token lijiye.

73
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:52,721
Chintu: Bhai... 999?!

74
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:55,100
Bunty: ...Koi baat nahi. Wait karte hain.

75
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:08,900
Bunty: SAARA PAISA MERE HAWALE KARO!

76
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:11,700
Cashier: Aadhaar card dikhaiye.

77
00:06:13,100 --> 00:06:15,900
Cashier: Ye lijiye. Pachaas rupaye.

78
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:18,784
Bunty: Yesss! DAKAITI SUCCESSFUL!

79
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:21,900
Chintu: Bhai... ye toh tere hi account ka paisa tha.

80
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:27,239
Cashier: Banana se dakaiti? Alarm toh banta hai.

81
00:06:27,100 --> 00:06:29,100
Bunty: BHAAAAGOOOO!!!

82
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:37,033
anchor: Namaskar! Aap dekh rahe hain Palm Bay News.

83
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:40,700
anchor: Aaj shehar ke bank mein ek ajeeb dakaiti hui.

84
00:06:40,900 --> 00:06:44,500
anchor: Dakait ke paas hathiyaar tha... ek kela.

85
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:50,191
anchor: Unhone line mein lagkar, token lekar, apne hi account se pachaas rupaye loote.

86
00:06:50,300 --> 00:06:54,350
Police Uncle: Hum unhe zaroor pakdenge. Bas pehle... chai pee lein.

87
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:57,100
Police Uncle: Aur haan... helmet zaroor pehnna!

88
00:06:57,400 --> 00:07:02,910
anchor: Khabar likhe jaane tak, dakait ek auto mein faraar hain. Bane rahiye hamare saath!

89
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:10,172
Chintu: Bhai, tu auto chalana jaanta hai?!

90
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:14,532
Bunty: Nahi! Par aaj seekh jaaunga!

91
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:16,760
Chintu: Bhai wo kyun phata?!

92
00:07:17,300 --> 00:07:21,500
Bunty: Open world hai bhai! Yahan sab apne aap phat-ta hai!

93
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:26,060
Police (Helicopter): AUTO ROK DO! Turant!

94
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:30,700
Bunty: Meter chalu hai, uncle! Rukega nahi!

95
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:34,340
Chintu: Bhai auto ek taraf jhuk gaya!!

96
00:07:34,700 --> 00:07:37,540
Bunty: Isko kehte hain... DESI DRIFT!

97
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:40,882
Chintu: Bhai aage pul toota hua hai!!

98
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:43,000
Bunty: Bollywood stunt time!

99
00:07:43,900 --> 00:07:47,500
Chintu: MUMMYYYYY!!!

100
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:51,300
Bunty: HUM BACH GAYE!!

101
00:07:51,100 --> 00:07:53,300
Chintu: Bhai tu legend hai!

102
00:07:56,900 --> 00:08:00,500
Mummy: CHINTU!! Raat ke 9 baje kahan ghoom raha hai?!

103
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:03,800
Chintu: M-Mummy... main toh tuition gaya tha!

104
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:07,600
Mummy: Tuition? AUTO mein? POLICE ke saath?!

105
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:10,830
Police Uncle: Madam, ye dono bahut bade criminal—

106
00:08:11,100 --> 00:08:14,450
Police Uncle: ...hum toh bas jaa rahe the. Namaste ji!

107
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:17,100
Bunty: Aunty ji, hum samjha sakte hain...

108
00:08:24,500 --> 00:08:28,100
Bunty: ...ye chappal heat-seeking thi kya?

109
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:42,200
Chintu: Bhai... toh humne aaj kamaya kya?

110
00:08:42,500 --> 00:08:46,037
Bunty: Experience, Chintu. EXPERIENCE.

111
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:51,300
Bunty: ...Toh? Ek baar aur khelein?

112
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:53,500
Chintu: BHAIII!!!

113
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:58,500
Mummy: Kya chal raha hai yahan?

114
00:09:02,700 --> 00:09:05,300
Mummy: Hmm. Achhe bachche.

115
00:09:06,500 --> 00:09:08,900
Bunty: ...kal phir chalein?

116
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:11,100
Chintu: ...haan.

117
00:09:15,500 --> 00:09:18,900
Police Uncle: Madam, itni raat ko itni tez gaadi?

118
00:09:19,100 --> 00:09:21,500
Dadi: Race lagayega, beta?

119
00:09:24,700 --> 00:09:28,500
Police Uncle: ...Nahi madam. Main toh chai peene jaa raha hoon.

120
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:40,700
Bunty: Video pasand aaya toh LIKE karo!

121
00:09:40,900 --> 00:09:43,300
Chintu: Aur SUBSCRIBE karo!

122
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:47,100
Bunty: Warna... wanted level badh jaayega!
